<section id="example" class="blogpost">
  <button class="theseus-mobile-menu-btn" id="theseus-mobile-menu-toggle" aria-label="Toggle sidebar">☰</button>
  <div id="theseus-sidebar-overlay"></div>
  <div class="row" id="contentBox">
    <div class="col-xs-2" id="theseus-sidebar">
      <button class="mobile-close-btn" id="theseus-mobile-close-sidebar" aria-label="Close sidebar" style="display: none; position: absolute; top: 10px; right: 10px; background: #333; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 4px; padding: 8px 12px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 18px;">✕</button>
      <div id="logo-replacement">
        <a href="/">
          <img class="mw-logo-icon" src="https://en.wikipedia.org/static/images/icons/wikipedia.png" alt=""
            aria-hidden="true" height="50" width="50">
          <span class="mw-logo-container">
            <h1>David's Dataviz</h1>
            <h2>Not actually Wikipedia</h2>
          </span>
        </a>

      </div>

      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Vitae dolorum aliquam tempore quasi aperiam magni
        soluta. Voluptates rem voluptate culpa repellendus voluptas unde, dignissimos veritatis, doloremque porro rerum,
        suscipit nihil.</p>

      <div id="sideinfo"></div>

    </div>
    <div class="col-xs-8" id="content-main">
      <div id="header">
        <h1>Ship of Theseus</h1>
        <div id="controls" style="margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 10px; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 4px;">
          <div id="controls-row-1" style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px;">
            <button id="btn-back" style="padding: 8px 16px; cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0;">← Back</button>
            <div id="date-revision-group" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0;">
              <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; margin: 0; white-space: nowrap;">
                <span style="white-space: nowrap;">Jump to date:</span>
                <input type="datetime-local" id="date-input" style="padding: 4px 8px; flex-shrink: 0;" />
              </label>
              <span id="revision-info" style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #666; flex-shrink: 0; white-space: nowrap;"></span>
            </div>
            <button id="btn-forward" style="padding: 8px 16px; cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0;">Forward →</button>
          </div>
          <div id="controls-row-2" style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
            <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; cursor: pointer; margin: 0;">
              <input type="checkbox" id="toggle-raw" />
              <span>Show raw wikimarkdown</span>
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="slider"></div>
      </div>

      <div id="main">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

